      "text": "Amazon DynamoDB (Pay-Per-Request)\n1. chargeguard-transactions\n   PK: user_id | SK: posted_at#transaction_id | GSI: merchant-index\n\n2. chargeguard-cases\n   PK: case_id | GSI: user-index | GSI: status-index\n\n3. chargeguard-decisions\n   PK: decision_id | GSI: case-index | GSI: pending-index\n   (Used by Backend Decisions & Mock Merchant Disputes)",
