    },
    {
      "id": "746d0d3d-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#581c87",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1010,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Decision Card (Safe Autonomous Settlement)\n1. Anomaly & Evidence are gathered 100% autonomously.\n2. Dispute filed to merchant -> Merchant returns counter-offer ($6.59).\n3. NegotiationAgent analyzes counter-offer vs evidence -> Recommends action.\n4. [CRITICAL PAUSE]: Case transitions to 'awaiting_human'.\n   The agent REFUSES to accept or reject money without the user.\n5. User sees Decision Card in Amplify Dashboard:\n   \u2022 Option A: [Aceptar Oferta ($6.59)] -> Instant credit, case resolved.\n   \u2022 Option B: [Rechazar y Solicitar Reembolso Completo] -> Escalated.\n6. User clicks -> POST /decisions/{case_id}/resolve -> Closed safely.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Decision Card (Safe Autonomous Settlement)\n1. Anomaly & Evidence are gathered 100% autonomously.\n2. Dispute filed to merchant -> Merchant returns counter-offer ($6.59).\n3. NegotiationAgent analyzes counter-offer vs evidence -> Recommends action.\n4. [CRITICAL PAUSE]: Case transitions to 'awaiting_human'.\n   The agent REFUSES to accept or reject money without the user.\n5. User sees Decision Card in Amplify Dashboard:\n   \u2022 Option A: [Aceptar Oferta ($6.59)] -> Instant credit, case resolved.\n   \u2022 Option B: [Rechazar y Solicitar Reembolso Completo] -> Escalated.\n6. User clicks -> POST /decisions/{case_id}/resolve -> Closed safely.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
