      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS Budgets & Cost Guardrails ($40 Monthly Cap)\n\u2022 Zero Idle Cost: All compute (Lambda, API Gateway) and storage (DynamoDB PAY_PER_REQUEST, S3) scale to $0 when idle.\n\u2022 Hard Budget: $40.00 USD monthly limit with SNS / Email alerts at 50% ($20.00) and 80% ($32.00).\n\u2022 Security & IAM: GitHub Actions OIDC (No permanent static AWS secrets) + Least Privilege Role Scopes.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS Budgets & Cost Guardrails ($40 Monthly Cap)\n\u2022 Zero Idle Cost: All compute (Lambda, API Gateway) and storage (DynamoDB PAY_PER_REQUEST, S3) scale to $0 when idle.\n\u2022 Hard Budget: $40.00 USD monthly limit with SNS / Email alerts at 50% ($20.00) and 80% ($32.00).\n\u2022 Security & IAM: GitHub Actions OIDC (No permanent static AWS secrets) + Least Privilege Role Scopes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
